    - rid: 7133309420632277527
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{"text":"1. Place all card image(s) with their correct name(s)
          AND CORRECT FILE TYPE in a folder.\n2. Select the folder using the button
          above.\n3. The name of the Set will appear above, and the name of the Cards
          in that Set will appear here in this text box. Changes will not be saved
